---
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">How it works</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Three steps, then just read</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      No clutter, no apps to open. Save an article and pick it up on
      your e-reader in seconds.
    </p>

    <div class="steps-row">
      <div class="step-card">
        <p class="step-num">Step 01</p>
        <h3>Paste a URL</h3>
        <p>Use the web app or the browser extension to submit any article, essay, or long-form page.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <p class="step-num">Step 02</p>
        <h3>We clean it up</h3>
        <p>Save to Ink strips ads, nav, and noise. What's left is the actual content, formatted as a proper EPUB.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <p class="step-num">Step 03</p>
        <h3>Delivered to your device</h3>
        <p>The EPUB lands in your Kindle or Kobo library automatically — ready to read, offline, on your own terms.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
	.steps-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.step-card {
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 4%, var(--paper));
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--card-radius);
		padding: 1.5rem;
		text-align: left;
	}

	.step-num {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.step-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	.step-card p {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--muted);
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}
</style>
